; The body cannot reach a piece that is more than a few centimetres away
; from its box, so the metre of slack is more than the geometry needs.
; A quarter of a metre still leaves the spans alone, and more of the
; stretch is skipped per frame.

(define (collide-far? q left right)
  (let ((px (piece-x q)))
    (or (> px (+ right 0.25))
        (< (+ (+ px (piece-w q)) 0.25) left))))
